[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0010","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0020","text":"来晚了，抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0030","text":"找导演多花了点时间……\n阳希，紧张了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0040","text":"嗯……\n我应该是紧张的……才对……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0050","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0060","text":"像这样跟您聊着聊着，\n自己的节奏就回来了，这种情况挺多的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0070","text":"我的必备单品……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0080","text":"阳希？怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0090","text":"呵呵，没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0100","text":"Producer先生，我出发了\n请像平时一样，看着我……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800800_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
